      "id": "ship-reason-field",
      "agent": "auto",
      "prompt": "The change that makes the ship clean-tree check ignore swarm-generated files also changed the refusal result so the reason text includes the blocking files; the existing test in tests/ship.test.mjs named 'ship: refuses with commit first when the tree is dirty, and never pushes' pins result.reason to exactly the text commit first and now fails. Fix tools/ship.mjs so result.reason stays exactly commit first and the blocking files go in a separate field result.blockers (array of project-relative path strings, at most 20) and, where the refusal is printed for the user, the message lists them. Do not change tests/ship.test.mjs expectations for reason; update tests/ship-clean-tree.test.mjs so it asserts reason equals commit first and blockers lists the blocking files. Write only tools/ship.mjs and tests/ship-clean-tree.test.mjs.",
      "context": [
        "tools/ship.mjs",
        "tests/ship.test.mjs",
        "tests/ship-clean-tree.test.mjs"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "tools/ship.mjs",
        "tests/ship-clean-tree.test.mjs"
      ],
